      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: Hi PhaseDragon,\nI'm Instantiating from a prefab, although I've also tried instantiating from an existing object in the scene as well. I've created a sample world (google link below) where I've recreated the issue in an isolated project. I set up everything as it is in my original project, which is a mix of both Udon and Udon#. My project has been in development for over a year; when I started I was only using Udon before discovering Udon#. I've also written a read me that discusses the project files and left comments in all of my scripts and Udon node files. I tried making this a GitHub repository but some files were too big. I found that if you extract the zip, ignore the broken files (most of them are meta files) and recompile the udon# code you can see the issue. Hope this helps!\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1e8x_1f2Cs4JxP-9fE_qD4totXsv54BWQ?usp=sharing",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
