      "value": "@{5f7a4bd22b1d0d69b4b27e3e|full_name}: when it comes out depends entirely on the internal release schedule. A whole update will not be made for a single bug fix, so it will have to wait until other projects are finished. We cannot provide exact dates, but I doubt it will be more than a few weeks. Updates are posted on twitter, discord, and steam.\nTo be clear, this does not affect the vrchat client. It is only an SDK issue. I would recommend just testing inside vrchat instead of cyanemu. The latest SDK even comes with the new reloading feature, which speeds up iteration time even more.",
      "viewerReactions": null
