  "details": "I'm having an issue where Udon behaviors don't run if they start as inactive on a vrc instantiated object. My scripts won't run after I set them active and if it's an Udon Sharp script they lose all their variables values. This is happening to me in editor. I'm also using the latest SDK and latest Udon Sharp and CyanEmu packages as of 8/5/21 for this project. The only error I get is the one attached, but this is only an Udon Sharp GUI error that shows up when I click on an udon behavior component with an udon sharp script, so unsure how helpful this is to fix the problem.\nThe issue doesn't happen if the udon behavior is enabled when I run vrc instantiate. Also my reasoning for having inactive components is to semi recreate Unity's animation event system so I can use an animator to control enable and disable certain aspects of an NPC's behavior\nThanks In advance.",
